=6AAE9B07"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Gemini_Generated_Image_q4lsvwq4lsvwq4ls.png", "id": "2120110958738604", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302483_2120110962071937_8265361888699801887_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0TxfMo2ZLtwQ7kNvwFRaWuT&_nc_oc=AdpFUhxCu8g2M9q-QbaN6hIUMI-_yTFK59zU5zb2iOXECVdH_PlIA-hCp__U0OA8QPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJfztlwbcF7fpQUGyV1pyKtLclM9IxFDsB6W1L3xVrYjg&oe=6AAE9CD8"}, "display_name": "Im A Rascal", "keywords": ["prank", "Funny", "slap", "fighting", "school"], "long_description": "CAUSE CHAOS IN CLASS\nStep into the role of a mischievous student and turn your classroom upside down! Your main task is simple: disrupt everything and everyone. Throw apples at classmates, prank teachers with funny tricks, and make the classroom a chaotic playground.\n\nFLIP THE CLASSROOM\n\nKnock over desks, throw students and teachers around, and watch the hilarious reactions. From slapping pranks to over-the-top mayhem, nothing is off-limits in your mission to create total disorder.\n{931255579317179}\n\n\nDRINK THE GIANT POTION\n\nGrab the magical potion and watch yourself grow into a towering giant! Smash through desks, lift classmates and teachers.\n\n{1667556514258190}\n\nPURE FUN AND LAUGHTER\nI\u2019m a Rascal! is all about hilarious moments, chaos, and over-the-top mischief. Are you ready to cause mayhem in the classroom? \n\n\n\n{648534651686094}", "short_description": "Step into the chaos as a mischievous student! Throw apples, prank teachers, blast noises, grow huge with magic potions, and toss classmates around. Pure classroom mayhem awaits in I\u2019m a Rascal!"}]}, "developer_name": "JB Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JB Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/